# Harvard Education Letter. Volume 26, Number 3, May-June 2010

**Authors:** Chauncey, Caroline T., Ed.

## Abstract
"Harvard Education Letter" is published bimonthly at the Harvard Graduate School of Education. This issue of "Harvard Education Letter" contains the following articles: (1) Unleashing the "Brain Power" of Groups in the Classroom: The Neuroscience behind Collaborative Work (Nancy Walser); (2) Putting AP to the Test: New Research Assesses the Advanced Placement Program; and (3) Once a Teacher, Always a Teacher? Specialized Roles Offer New Promise for Retaining and Developing Talent (Susan Moore Johnson).

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED519756

